WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.370
Scams, pop-ups, confusing forms. The web can feel overwhelming.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.690
This is Tusk. A little elephant in the corner.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.920
No app to learn, no account. Just help where you are.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.920
When a banner blocks the page, Tusk points to the safe choice.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.240
Ask in your own words. Tusk shows you the next step.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:34.610
If an email is not what it seems, Tusk warns you.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.260
Forms, field by field. One clear step.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.670
In your language: English, German, Spanish.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.470
No passwords. Scam warnings. Asks first.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:56.670
No Little Tusk servers. No account. Your own A.I. key.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:02.270
Set it up for someone you love. One simple link, guardrails included.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.050
Little Tusk. A little help for a big web.
